{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":0,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{"tools":{"listChanged":false}},"serverInfo":{"name":"anyknown","title":"anyknown browser","version":"0.1.0"},"instructions":"A web browser without pixels. Start with browser_navigate; browser_snapshot lists the page as an accessibility tree whose interactive elements and headings carry refs like e12; act on them with browser_click, browser_type, browser_select. browser_read gives the main content as Markdown. Pages run their scripts: browser_eval runs JavaScript in the page, browser_wait lets timers run (page time, not real time)."}}
